# AI Document Intelligence & RAG Assistant – Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your credentials.
# The application works WITHOUT any API key (deterministic fallback
# generator is used). API keys unlock higher-quality LLM answers.

# Optional – OpenAI (GPT-4o-mini or similar)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional – Groq (llama-3.1-8b-instant or similar, free tier available)
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
